# Spacing grid

Standard rhythm: `4px` (gap-1/p-1) · `8px` (gap-2/p-2) · `12px` (gap-3/p-3) · `16px` (gap-4/p-4)

```tsx
// ✅
<div className="flex gap-2 p-4" />
<div className="px-4 py-2" />

// ⛔ Magic numbers
<div className="gap-[10px] p-[14px]" />
<div style={{ padding: '10px' }} />
```

- Prefer `flex` + `gap` over `margin` between siblings
- Border radius: `rounded` (--radius) · `rounded-sm` · `rounded-md` · `rounded-xl` · `rounded-full`
